Title: Family Dinner
Author: Test User

INT. DINING ROOM - NIGHT

A family sits around an unusually quiet dinner table.

MOTHER
So, Daniel. How is the new job?

DANIEL
Great.

Daniel's phone vibrates.

ON SCREEN: "We regret to inform you..."

Daniel immediately flips the phone face down.

FATHER
Good company?

DANIEL
Very stable.

His phone vibrates again.

ON SCREEN: "FINAL PAYCHECK DEPOSITED."

His younger sister LUCY notices.

LUCY
Very stable?

Daniel gives her a warning look.

Lucy slowly smiles.

---

INT. KITCHEN - LATER

Daniel washes dishes while Lucy leans against the counter.

LUCY
You got fired.

DANIEL
Technically the position was eliminated.

LUCY
Along with your access card?

Daniel stops washing.

DANIEL
How do you know about that?

Lucy holds up his access card.

LUCY
You put this in the refrigerator.

Daniel stares at it.

---

EXT. FRONT PORCH - NIGHT

Daniel sits alone on the steps.

His father comes outside and sits beside him.

For a while neither speaks.

FATHER
You don't have to pretend with us.

Daniel looks down.

DANIEL
I didn't want everyone worrying.

FATHER
We're your family. Worrying is included.

Daniel laughs quietly.

They sit together in silence.
